{"v":4,"catch":"使用魔術的力量打敗龍！","desc":"Wiz是1985年由“ SEIBU KAIHATSU”發行的動作遊戲。\n扮演Wiz，一個可以控制8種魔法的巫師，可以從地下到地面進行戰鬥，最後進入天空。\n擊敗擋在你面前的怪物，使其堅如磐石，與龍對峙。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2020-06-25","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6a41e45f9924d82b0f85ac7e4aec663a681296149e95bff46dd02e3fbb1028d3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/32095b4706393e27c2d198e10911c7c06e31d2da0cbe1c31b4910993f63c278a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7f36a8b844fbc8d7ebabd94ab667a5692e37269d21dce325903ca48e0af67916.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/dff27ac177add240694660a5157e27f1f77882d3397957b0144d49a21546e580.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1631ae84b172b6ec78019e4ad795c50ad527464068210c8455b79c81c04ecb04.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/277279c9ac02a8aa4cba0e0faaec2ef2db479db1871727659de4679d7deee9f4.jpg"],"titleId":"0100abb00e352000","dlc":[]}